### Get all boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new box
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "Sweet Snacks",
  "price": 19.99,
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Brownie Bite",
      "category": "Bakery"
    },
    {
      "name": "Strawberry Cookie",
      "category": "Cookie"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get boxes by theme
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/theme/SweetSnacks
Accept: application/json

###

### Get box by ID (Example: ID = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update an existing box (Example: ID = 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "Updated Snacks Box",
  "price": 29.99,
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Matcha Cookie",
      "category": "Cookie"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cheesecake Square",
      "category": "Bakery"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Delete a box (Example: ID = 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/1

###

### Add an item to existing box (if implemented via PATCH or special endpoint)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chocolate Muffin",
  "category": "Bakery"
}
